            <p>
              In Microsoft Word: <strong>File → Info → Check for Issues → Inspect Document</strong>
              → remove personal information before saving as PDF. This is the cleanest
              approach because it prevents metadata from entering the PDF at all.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-box">
          <div class="step-num">2</div>
