            <h4>Add it to your document workflow policy</h4>
            <p>
              Update your HR document handling procedure to include a mandatory
              metadata strip step for all externally shared documents. Train the
              team once — it takes five minutes to explain and saves significant
              potential embarrassment or liability.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

