      <h2 id="fix-jobseeker">How job seekers should fix this</h2>

      <p>
        Three things to do before sending any application document as a PDF:
      </p>

      <div class="step-list">
        <div class="step-box">
          <div class="step-num">1</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h4>Always create job search documents on a personal device</h4>
            <p>
              This is the single most important step. A resume created on a personal
              laptop will have your name in the Author field — not your employer's name
              in the Company/Creator field. Never create or edit job search documents
              on a work computer.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-box">
          <div class="step-num">2</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h4>Strip metadata before every application</h4>
            <p>
