        </div>
        <div class="step-box">
          <div class="step-num">3</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h4>Check your own documents before they go out</h4>
            <p>
              Use the same inspector to verify what you're about to send.
              Seeing your current employer's name in the Creator field
